  "solution": "Đặt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Khi đó phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (1) trở thành \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTa có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Để phương trình (1) có hai nghiệm thực phân biệt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math> thì phương trình (2) phải có hai nghiệm dương phân biệt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math>. Khi đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta thấy phương trình (2) có hai nghiệm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.